OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 20 MAR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Donizetti
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod follows the
OL,6,     Girresistible rise of Italian
OL,7,     Gopera composer Gaetano Donizetti.
OL,8,     GToday, he tells the story of
OL,9,     GDonizetti's prolific and dramatic
OL,10,     Glate years.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GKate Derham is joined in studio
OL,13,     Gfor live performances from Tunde
OL,14,     GJegede to promote his Wigmore
OL,15,     GHall Concert. Also, Kitty Whately
OL,16,     Gand Julius Drake promote their
OL,17,     Gnew album.
OL,18,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,19,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,20,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
